SGL @SGL_DOCS_VERSION@ Documentation
===================================

This archive contains the generated Simple Graphics Library user manual and
public API reference.

Open `html/index.html` in a web browser. The HTML tree is self-contained and
does not require a web server or an internet connection.

The documentation describes the public headers and behavior released with SGL
version @SGL_DOCS_VERSION@. See `LICENSE` for distribution terms.
